; The Door (BH2 Campaign, crate / door / Obelisk scenes): D phrygian, 88 bpm. A clarinet four-note figure (D Eb G F#) over a D/E-flat hum, a heartbeat timpani, strings joining after eight bars. Quiet, sparse, loops under dialogue.
; Original notes; AW2's own voices; no rom lines.
